\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang2057\ul\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone 
\par 1. SING Alleluia forth in duteous 
\par praise,
\par O citizens of heaven, and sweetly 
\par raise
\par An endless Alleluia!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The Holy city shall take up your 
\par strain,
\par And with glad songs resounding 
\par wake again
\par An endless Alleluia!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. There, in one grand acclaim, 
\par for ever ring
\par The strains which tell the honour 
\par of your King,
\par An endless alleluia!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. This is the rest for weary ones 
\par brought back,
\par This is the food and drink which 
\par none shall lack,
\par An endless Alleluia!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5 \cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. While Thee, by whom were all things 
\par made, we praise,
\par For ever, and tell out in sweetest lays
\par An endless Alleluia!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. To Thee, Eternal Son, our voices 
\par sing;
\par With them, O Holy Ghost, to Thee 
\par we bring
\par An endless Alleluia!
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang2057\ul\f2\fs16 
\par }

